# Line endings.
#
# yt2disc has two halves that run on two different operating systems: the
# desktop add-on on Windows, the hosted converter on Debian (Render's native
# runtimes are Debian 12 "bookworm").  The repository is the one place that has
# to agree on a single answer, so text is stored as LF and checked out with
# whatever the platform prefers.
* text=auto

# Never let Git translate these: a rewritten byte corrupts them.
*.exe   binary
*.ico   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ogg   binary
